        },
        {
          "role": "npc",
          "npc_id": "herbalist_iona",
          "text": "我可以同行。先确认路上的安全，病人等不了太久。",
          "emotion": {
            "coarse": "neutral",
            "primary": "calm",
            "secondary": null,
            "intensity": 0.5,
            "valence": 0.0,
            "arousal": 0.4
          },
          "status": "completed",
          "turn_id": "npc:db56485f2a7853d3b064547ff3ae0c2eac5fc37c"
        },
        {
          "role": "npc",
          "npc_id": "elder_maren",
          "text": "路况仍待守卫核实；伊奥娜的同行条件也保留着。旧信委托等你决定。",
          "emotion": {
            "coarse": "neutral",
            "primary": "calm",
            "secondary": null,
            "intensity": 0.5,
            "valence": 0.0,
            "arousal": 0.4
          },
          "status": "completed",
          "turn_id": "npc:9badbc91b57ded33d8778e8b1fc3b49525c320db"
        },
        {
          "role": "player",
          "npc_id": "elder_maren",
          "text": "旧信先让我想想。现在护送条件里，哪些还没确认？",
          "session": "main"
        },
        {
          "role": "npc",
          "npc_id": "elder_maren",
          "text": "旧信的事等你决定。护送路况还需核实，不能先当作安全。",
          "emotion": {
            "coarse": "neutral",
            "primary": "calm",
            "secondary": null,
            "intensity": 0.5,
            "valence": 0.0,
            "arousal": 0.4
          },
          "status": "completed",
          "turn_id": "eval:cooperation_review_demo:1:main:turn:1"
        },
        {
          "role": "player",
          "npc_id": "elder_maren",
          "text": "对，记住我只是听了旧信委托，还没接受。",
          "session": "main"
